1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
AI can give you a polished answer
in seconds.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
But here's the uncomfortable question:

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
did you learn it, or did the AI
simply perform the thinking for you?

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Sparring changes that contract.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:23,000
I upload the PDF I actually need
to study, and the AI

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
turns only that material into
three concepts and one clear target.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Before it explains anything,
I make a quick prediction.

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,500
It isn't a grade or an entrance test.

9
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:44,000
It gives me something real to compare
with this short, source-grounded explanation.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Now I answer before feedback,
and I have to say how confident I am.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Here I was very sure - and wrong.

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Sparring shows why my choice fails
and why the material supports

13
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,500
a different relationship. That mismatch
is more useful than a score alone.

14
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:08,500
Next, I teach the idea back
in two lines.

15
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:15,000
My first version only lists the parts,
so the AI asks for one missing connection.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:19,000
I revise it;
the explanation stays mine.

17
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Then I come back later.
The same objective returns in new wording,

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
with no hint before I commit. A pass
schedules day three, then day seven.

19
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:35,000
We call this practice evidence -
not permanent mastery.

20
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,000
FastAPI keeps the model key
on the server.

21
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Structured outputs and source-anchor checks
keep every generated step

22
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,000
inside my uploaded material.

23
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Sparring. The AI study coach
that refuses to think for you.
